<ul>
 <li><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">Step 1: Login to Polarion Porta=
l</span></li>
 <li><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">Step 2: Select Project - Polari=
on Administration Tools</span></li>
 <li>Step 3: Select Document &amp; Pages -&gt; =E2=80=9CUser Management=E2=
=80=9D space</li>
 <li><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">Step 4: Select Project Role Ass=
ignment page</span></li>
 <li><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">Step 5: Select project PROJECT_=
NAME (Which is mentioned in request form by the User)<br></span><span class=
